SUMMARY:Stand-Up Showcase
LOCATION:Washington
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy great stand-up comedy in downtown DC. Our showcase lineup
 s feature top talent from DC\, Maryland\, Virginia and beyond\, performing 
 on one of the country's most famous stages. You'll see a variety of styles 
 and get up close with some of the stars of tomorrow. Support local talent\,
  support local business and (most important) laugh your a** off. Showcases 
 generally last around 90 minutes.\n\nAugust 14-16 lineup: Dom Grayer\, Liam
  Nelson\, Dom Hatton-Woods\, Ty Colgate\n\nAugust 21-23 lineup: Kade Wonder
 s\, Garrett Harvest\, Aminah Imani\, Randy Syphax\, Jamal Russell\n\nAugust
  28-30 lineup: Dale Dunlap\, Ray Diva\, Matt Brown\, Stacey Axler\, Dom Gra
 yer\n\nSeptember 5-6 lineup: Tre Solomon\, Jenny Questell\, Ross Benoit\, C
 hanel Ali\, Mike Kurtz\n\nAll sales are final. Refunds and exchanges are of
 fered only when a show is canceled or rescheduled.\n\nAdmission Policies\n\
 nPatrons must be 18 or older to attend events or classes at the DC Improv. 
 Any exceptions are clearly noted in the event descriptions.\n\nThere is a t
 wo-item minimum per customer. This can be any combination of food items or 
 beverages. Bottled water and soft drinks count as items. (The two-item mini
 mum does not apply to comedy classes.)\n\nCoupons or passes for free admiss
 ion cannot be used for a show listed as a "special event."\n\nSeating Polic
 ies\n\nAll shows in our lounge showroom are seated by time of arrival. The 
 earlier you arrive\, the more options you'll have. Please note that the siz
 e of your party can affect what options are available to you\, as certain t
 ables and areas are designated for larger parties.\n\nFor general admission
  tickets\, if your party does not fill an entire table\, you may be sharing
  a table with other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atl
 as/event/stand-up-showcase-25110/
